- `ShipmentTracker.Client/` - client (WebAssembly) project

Key facts about Auto Global mode:
- Interactive components MUST go in the `.Client` project
- Components cannot access DbContext directly - must use HTTP APIs
- Both Program.cs files must register matching service interfaces
- The server project has Identity auth configured with SQLite

## Requirements
1. Dispatchers view a list of shipments with status and destination
2. Customers check their shipment status and estimated delivery
3. Authentication with Individual accounts (already scaffolded)
4. Staff (dispatchers) and customers have different roles

